    bart "And when this girl, got in the way... when she corrupted the Planet Destroyer, I took matters into my own hands."
    kagu "How did you do it. How did you harness the power of a god... enough to misalign the cosmos."
    show bart happy
    bart "The God’s Ore, of course... Ultima. I fully understand why our keepers have such a system in place now..."
